          "docs": "Route payment files into Agicap in any standard banking format. Once imported, the files are processed and sent to the bank without any modifications.<br/>Supported Formats: the API supports all standard banking formats in `.xml` and `.txt`\n\n**Required OAuth scopes:**\n\n- `agicap:public-api`\n- `public-api:import_payment_files`"
